OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for killing ex days
OL,4,Aafter his release
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had been released on licence from
OL,7,FHMP Wandsworth on 17 October 2025 after
OL,8,Fbeing sentenced the day before to a
OL,9,F12-month jail sentence for possession
OL,10,Fof a bladed article and harassment. He
OL,11,Fhad been in prison on remand since May
OL,12,F2025 when he was freed.
OL,14,FSabat, of Balham, was jailed for life
OL,15,Fwith a minimum term of 17 years.
